      "content": "peace sounds nice. honestly it's the only thing i want. but when you say \"let go of the struggle,\" do you mean just relaxing, or do you mean like... actually giving up? because it feels like the only way to truly get that peace is to just not be here at all anymore. is it wrong to want that?",
